- SR-15 | medium | omission | “correct … Einstein A, frequency, partition function and lower-level energy” | The cited 2018A&A...615A..28D method additionally requires matching quantum numbers and no differential radiative pumping. Those conditions are missing from the operational instruction. | Require matched transitions and assess differential pumping; route unsuitable pairs to excitation/radiative-transfer modelling.

## Notes
The skill captures many important limitations and reproduces most supplied software counts accurately.
The main provenance problem is extensive reliance on “card” details absent from this evidence pack.
Keep reported molecular ratios, corrected D/H, assumed elemental inputs and derived opacities explicitly distinct.
